=== ArrayLiterals Sample ===
--- Single-element array ---
  [1]
--- Multi-element array ---
  [1, 2, 3]
--- Trailing comma ---
  [1, 2, 3]
--- Nested arrays ---
  [[1, 2], [3, 4]]
--- Array literal as method argument ---
  [4, 5, 6]
--- Array literal as return value ---
  [10, 20, 30]
--- Array literal as assignment RHS ---
  [7, 8, 9]
--- Explicit type annotation ---
  [1, 2, 3]
--- Empty array literal ---
  Length: 0
--- String array ---
  [hello, world]
--- Boolean array ---
  [True, False, True]
Done!
